449 0 obj
<<
/Title (The purpose is to turn raw Olympic data into clear, interactive insights that help sports strategists, investment analysts and journalists understand which sports and countries win the most medals, how medals changed over the years, which regions are the most efficient, and how host nations performed, so they can make informed decisions and tell clear stories.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 384 0 R
>>
